## Test runtime sync-and-restart helper

Run the new helper from the repo root whenever you need to refresh the test runtime, Prisma artifacts, and HTML mirrors
in lockstep, just like the live script:

```bash
cd /home/eagles/dockerz/sis
tools/sync-and-restart-test-runtime.sh <full|public|restart-only>
```

- `full`: runs the strict runtime whitelist sync, the strict public mirror sync,
   refreshes Prisma (`db:generate` +  `db:migrate:deploy`) under
   `/home/test.eagles.edu.vn/sis`, restarts `exercise-mailer-test.service`, and probes
  `http://127.0.0.1:8786/healthz`.
- `public`: runs the strict runtime whitelist sync and strict public mirror sync, then restarts + loopback health probe.
- `restart-only`: runs the strict runtime whitelist sync and strict public mirror sync, skips the admin asset build,
  refreshes Prisma, then restarts + loopback health probe.

The script assumes `.env.test` points at `sis-test`. Check `journalctl -u exercise-mailer-test.service` if you need
confirmation after running the helper.

